%% Adaptive LMS — Data Flow
%% Tracks a learning event from creation to competency update to reporting

sequenceDiagram
    participant L as Learner
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as API Service
    participant PG as PostgreSQL
    participant RS as Redis Stream
    participant EW as Event Worker
    participant AE as Adaptive Engine
    participant RE as Reporting Engine
    participant AI as AI Provider

    L->>FE: Answer question
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/events
    API->>API: Validate + Tenant check
    API->>PG: INSERT learning_event (immutable)
    API->>RS: Publish to "learning_events"
    API-->>FE: 201 Created

    RS->>EW: Consume event
    EW->>AE: Update competency
    AE->>PG: Read current learner_competency
    AE->>AE: Calculate mastery (weighted formula)
    AE->>PG: UPDATE learner_competency
    AE->>PG: INSERT competency_evidence

    Note over L,FE: Later, learner requests next content

    L->>FE: Request next content
    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/adaptive/next
    API->>AE: Get recommendation
    AE->>PG: Read competency state
    AE->>AE: Apply sequencing policy
    AE->>PG: INSERT adaptive_decision
    AE-->>API: AdaptiveNextResponse
    API-->>FE: Recommendation

    Note over L,FE: Later, user requests AI insight

    FE->>API: POST /api/v1/insights/generate
    API->>RE: Generate insight
    RE->>PG: Query learning_events + competencies
    RE->>RE: Calculate deterministic analytics
    RE->>RE: Build evidence package
    RE->>AI: Send analytics + evidence to LLM
    AI-->>RE: Structured JSON with claims
    RE->>RE: Validate citations
    RE->>PG: INSERT insight + insight_evidence
    RE-->>API: InsightResponse
    API-->>FE: Grounded insight with evidence IDs
